在当前块应用契约：校验字段类型/枚举/区间，并填充缺失字段的默认值。\\n\\n:
Apply a contract to the current block: validates field types/enums/ranges and fills in defaults for missing fields.

The contract must be defined before `@is`.

```sml
db {
    @is Server
    host: db1.internal
}
```

定义契约（schema），为块提供字段类型、枚举、默认值、区间约束。\\n\\n:
Define a contract (schema), providing field types, enums, defaults and range constraints for a block.

```sml
@contract Server {
    host: str
    port: int default 5432
}
```

The contract definition itself is not part of the parse result. `loose` is required to allow undeclared fields.
